WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.420 --> 01:42.300
[Episode 28]

02:36.910 --> 02:38.260
We finally meet.

02:38.680 --> 02:40.290
Fate's Chosen One.

02:41.030 --> 02:43.290
I'm Jin Chan.

02:44.750 --> 02:45.980
What did you just call me?

02:47.240 --> 02:50.850
You are the one chosen by Fate.

02:51.150 --> 02:53.940
The one chosen by Fate?

02:55.870 --> 02:57.980
Before Fate destroys all,

02:58.960 --> 03:01.410
it will choose someone to be a hero.

03:02.400 --> 03:03.380
In this era,

03:05.150 --> 03:08.500
you are the hero chosen by Fate.

03:13.710 --> 03:14.690
I once believed

03:15.630 --> 03:17.060
that Fate's Chosen One

03:17.750 --> 03:18.540
was her.

03:20.360 --> 03:22.220
It made me take many detours

03:23.710 --> 03:24.940
before I found you.

03:26.000 --> 03:27.450
How do you know Fate?

03:30.240 --> 03:31.010
Because

03:33.280 --> 03:34.660
I was once you.

03:41.080 --> 03:42.450
Everything's in a circle.

03:42.680 --> 03:43.940
All things rise and fall.

03:44.870 --> 03:46.940
This is the law of the Three Realms.

03:47.840 --> 03:50.260
Humans live and die;
flowers bloom and fall.

03:50.870 --> 03:52.100
It's the same for the Three Realms.

03:52.430 --> 03:53.690
After the Dragon-Phoenix Calamity,

03:54.280 --> 03:56.290
over half of ancient beings perished.

03:56.710 --> 03:57.980
After the Witch-Demon War,

03:58.750 --> 04:00.980
six out of ten creatures died.

04:01.470 --> 04:02.690
After the Deity-Demon War,

04:03.430 --> 04:05.690
only one in ten of the beings lived.

04:05.870 --> 04:06.660
This

04:07.680 --> 04:10.220
is my fourth Great Tribulation.

04:11.960 --> 04:13.260
What exactly are you?

04:15.520 --> 04:16.370
In this life,

04:17.160 --> 04:18.370
I go by Jin Chan.

04:19.240 --> 04:20.460
My former name

04:21.040 --> 04:22.100
is too far gone.

04:22.510 --> 04:23.660
I don't recall it.

04:24.000 --> 04:25.290
You've seen Fate?

04:27.390 --> 04:28.490
In the Dragon-Phoenix Calamity,

04:29.480 --> 04:31.850
I too was a hero chosen by Fate.

04:32.950 --> 04:33.850
Just like you,

04:34.310 --> 04:35.730
driven by Fate,

04:36.310 --> 04:37.700
I schemed endlessly,

04:39.040 --> 04:40.540
only to end the calamity

04:41.310 --> 04:44.370
that ravaged the Three Realms.

04:45.630 --> 04:46.900
What did you do then?

04:49.000 --> 04:49.730
Back then,

04:50.750 --> 04:52.140
I had many kin,

04:53.120 --> 04:54.020
many friends,

04:55.360 --> 04:56.340
and a lover.

04:58.360 --> 04:59.340
I only remember

05:00.360 --> 05:01.540
that I wanted to save them.

05:02.430 --> 05:04.700
But the Dragon-Phoenix Calamity
could ruin heaven and earth.

05:05.680 --> 05:06.460
How could I save them?

05:08.120 --> 05:09.170
It was at that time

05:11.040 --> 05:13.580
that I mastered the Time-Space Stasis.

05:13.920 --> 05:15.140
The Time-Space Stasis.

05:15.680 --> 05:16.610
That divine art

05:17.430 --> 05:18.700
takes a terrible toll.

05:19.750 --> 05:20.930
One use would drain

05:21.600 --> 05:24.050
a lifetime of spiritual power.

05:26.480 --> 05:27.900
But facing the apocalypse,

05:29.040 --> 05:29.980
apart from this move,

05:31.950 --> 05:33.370
I had no other way.

05:35.390 --> 05:36.170
I thought

05:36.870 --> 05:38.290
that if I had endless time

05:38.310 --> 05:39.730
and kept searching my mind,

05:40.560 --> 05:41.900
I would surely find

05:41.920 --> 05:43.490
a way to save everyone.

05:45.160 --> 05:46.700
Within that frozen time and space,

05:47.680 --> 05:49.660
I didn't know
how long I thought about it.

05:50.560 --> 05:51.540
Perhaps a thousand years,

05:52.270 --> 05:53.220
perhaps ten thousand,

05:54.040 --> 05:55.020
perhaps longer.

05:56.190 --> 05:57.850
But I never found that path.

05:59.160 --> 06:01.100
I exhausted a lifetime's
spiritual power,

06:01.950 --> 06:03.900
and in the end, I failed everything.

06:06.630 --> 06:07.780
Then, at one moment,

06:08.360 --> 06:09.410
I had a sudden realization:

06:10.510 --> 06:12.290
Why should I save everyone?

06:13.510 --> 06:15.370
Fate wants to destroy them.

06:15.920 --> 06:17.490
That is their destiny,

06:18.120 --> 06:20.700
so why should I oppose Fate?

06:22.120 --> 06:23.100
What did you do?

06:24.680 --> 06:25.460
I gave up

06:26.430 --> 06:27.900
being a hero.

06:31.430 --> 06:33.610
I let the Great Tribulation
destroy everything.

06:35.310 --> 06:36.290
I only remember

06:37.510 --> 06:38.900
that I sacrificed much.

06:39.720 --> 06:40.580
I've already forgotten

06:42.120 --> 06:43.290
the rest.

06:44.160 --> 06:45.290
From then on,

06:45.510 --> 06:46.900
I hid my name

06:47.040 --> 06:48.050
and waited in silence

06:48.070 --> 06:50.100
for each Great Tribulation.

06:50.480 --> 06:52.050
Before each Great Tribulation began,

06:53.160 --> 06:54.610
I could always find the one

06:54.630 --> 06:56.700
chosen by Fate.

07:00.920 --> 07:02.020
In the Witch-Demon War,

07:02.270 --> 07:03.700
Fate had chosen

07:04.160 --> 07:06.610
one of the Ancestral Witch heirs.

07:07.160 --> 07:08.900
He forged the Pregenesis Sword

07:09.190 --> 07:10.580
to break all magic arts
in the Mortal Realm,

07:11.190 --> 07:13.490
hoping to become the hero with it.

07:13.800 --> 07:14.610
But he did not.

07:15.800 --> 07:17.610
Within this Time-Space Stasis,

07:18.120 --> 07:19.700
he pondered for ages

07:20.000 --> 07:20.900
and reached one conclusion:

07:22.120 --> 07:23.660
Only when the Witch Clan fell

07:24.360 --> 07:26.220
could this Great Tribulation end.

07:27.800 --> 07:29.290
So, he betrayed the Witch Clan.

07:29.870 --> 07:31.700
He recast the Pregenesis Sword,

07:32.390 --> 07:34.700
making it unable
to restrain demonic arts,

07:35.360 --> 07:37.290
and gave it to the Demon Emperor.

07:38.920 --> 07:41.340
So, that's why the Sword
counters magic arts,

07:41.600 --> 07:42.700
not demonic arts.

07:43.070 --> 07:44.220
In the Deity-Demon War,

07:45.360 --> 07:46.780
the one chosen by Fate

07:47.510 --> 07:49.660
was a Quasi-Saint of the Human Clan.

07:50.680 --> 07:51.460
She

07:52.870 --> 07:54.490
was a true heroine.

07:54.680 --> 07:55.780
What did she do?

07:56.120 --> 07:58.140
She found a countermeasure.

07:58.360 --> 07:59.460
A countermeasure?

07:59.830 --> 08:01.580
In the Time-Space Stasis,

08:02.120 --> 08:03.810
she spent five hundred years

08:04.870 --> 08:07.810
refining the Ancestral Wu's remains
with her body

08:07.830 --> 08:08.930
and turned

08:11.720 --> 08:13.490
into the Sea-Calming Pillar.

08:15.510 --> 08:16.540
The Sea-Calming Pillar

08:16.920 --> 08:18.660
is forged from a human.

08:18.830 --> 08:21.250
If the Human Clan subdues
the Demon Emperor with it,

08:22.040 --> 08:24.020
it means Fate has chosen the Human Clan.

08:24.430 --> 08:25.340
If not,

08:26.720 --> 08:28.660
it means Fate has abandoned
the Human Clan.

08:29.120 --> 08:30.410
She did her best,

08:32.120 --> 08:33.850
leaving only the Pillar behind,

08:34.390 --> 08:36.420
entrusting all to Fated Mandate.

08:37.510 --> 08:39.220
All to Fated Mandate...

08:41.270 --> 08:42.650
Though she became a heroine,

08:43.790 --> 08:45.580
no one knows who she is.

08:48.120 --> 08:49.820
She erased her own existence,

08:50.910 --> 08:53.730
gaining a chance
to stop the Great Tribulation.

08:54.320 --> 08:55.100
This

08:55.910 --> 08:57.820
is her way to break the deadlock.

08:58.390 --> 08:59.580
A way to break the deadlock.

09:00.670 --> 09:01.730
The Sea-Calming Pillar.

09:07.510 --> 09:10.010
We are both heroes chosen by Fate.

09:12.120 --> 09:13.370
If Fate wants to destroy the world,

09:14.720 --> 09:16.010
how can we stop it?

09:16.480 --> 09:17.850
Three eras, three calamities.

09:18.270 --> 09:21.010
I found all whom Fate chose.

09:21.270 --> 09:22.530
Yet all our efforts

09:23.720 --> 09:25.460
were but mantis arms before a cart

09:27.080 --> 09:28.890
against Fate's grand design.

09:30.030 --> 09:30.940
How could we ever defy

09:32.440 --> 09:34.250
the Fated Mandate?

09:35.440 --> 09:36.220
Wrong.

09:38.240 --> 09:39.130
What is wrong?

09:40.000 --> 09:42.100
You hid one thing from me.

09:44.630 --> 09:46.420
You claim to serve Fate.

09:46.910 --> 09:48.490
Yet you never became a hero.

09:49.550 --> 09:50.820
Could it be

09:51.360 --> 09:52.850
that Fate cast you aside?

09:52.870 --> 09:55.850
You wanted its notice again,

09:56.200 --> 09:58.490
so you changed your face and name,

09:58.510 --> 10:00.610
studying its workings in secret,

10:00.840 --> 10:01.980
aiding Fate

10:02.080 --> 10:04.100
to bring each Great Tribulation.

10:04.150 --> 10:04.940
What if you

10:06.240 --> 10:09.100
are the hand behind every disaster?

10:12.630 --> 10:14.300
Where did I slip up?

10:17.030 --> 10:18.490
Because I know math.

10:20.270 --> 10:21.060
Math?

10:22.030 --> 10:23.490
It was 13,000 years

10:23.840 --> 10:25.610
between the Dragon-Phoenix Calamity

10:25.720 --> 10:27.300
and the Witch-Demon War.

10:27.480 --> 10:28.730
It was also 13,000 years

10:28.750 --> 10:30.100
between the Witch-Demon War

10:30.120 --> 10:31.650
and the Deity-Demon War.

10:31.720 --> 10:33.060
Yet from that war until now

10:33.080 --> 10:34.820
is only 1,000 years.

10:34.910 --> 10:36.490
Why won't Fate wait

10:36.510 --> 10:38.010
the remaining 12,000 years?

10:41.360 --> 10:42.490
The ways of Fate

10:43.080 --> 10:45.130
are beyond mortal understanding.

10:45.150 --> 10:45.770
Fine.

10:46.320 --> 10:47.730
Then let me put it another way.

10:48.720 --> 10:50.100
You said you've sacrificed too much

10:50.120 --> 10:51.980
and waited so long that you forgot.

10:53.080 --> 10:54.370
I don't think you can forget.

10:55.630 --> 10:57.720
♪I know the world's full of deceit♪

10:57.720 --> 10:58.490
Because

10:59.600 --> 11:01.420
you failed.

11:01.420 --> 11:05.000
♪Why not change forms and play♪

11:05.080 --> 11:06.850
You said you'd seen every hero.

11:06.960 --> 11:08.060
But if only heroes

11:08.080 --> 11:09.700
could stop the Great Tribulation,

11:09.960 --> 11:11.850
why did you appear then?

11:11.870 --> 11:13.060
Could it be because

11:13.320 --> 11:15.980
you never meant to stop it

11:16.000 --> 11:17.460
but to bring it on?

11:17.630 --> 11:18.980
You want to prove to Fate

11:19.240 --> 11:20.100
that your failure

11:20.120 --> 11:21.490
wasn't due to your own limits

11:21.630 --> 11:23.490
but because no one can succeed.

11:23.720 --> 11:25.180
You spent a lifetime's cultivation

11:25.320 --> 11:26.530
on the Time-Space Stasis

11:26.550 --> 11:27.980
to trap those heroes

11:28.000 --> 11:29.610
and wear them down

11:29.630 --> 11:32.250
until they gave up being heroes.

11:32.630 --> 11:33.610
Am I right?

11:35.510 --> 11:36.940
Fate!

11:38.320 --> 11:40.460
I'm no hero!

11:41.000 --> 11:43.850
I lost completely!

11:45.670 --> 11:46.460
Indeed.

11:47.910 --> 11:49.960
♪And set formations in the world♪

11:50.480 --> 11:51.370
In the Witch-Demon War,

11:51.840 --> 11:53.180
that Witch Clan hero

11:53.320 --> 11:55.220
only recast the Pregenesis Sword

11:55.320 --> 11:56.340
because you

11:56.510 --> 11:58.100
bewitched him for hundreds of years

11:58.440 --> 12:01.040
in this Time-Space Stasis, right?

12:05.400 --> 12:06.530
In the Deity-Demon War,

12:07.320 --> 12:09.050
I planned to use the same old trick.

12:10.310 --> 12:11.740
Sadly, it didn't work.

12:11.870 --> 12:13.100
In the Deity-Demon War,

12:13.520 --> 12:15.450
the deadlock

12:16.200 --> 12:17.300
the Quasi-Saint heroine broke

12:17.840 --> 12:20.500
wasn't the one set by Fate,

12:20.520 --> 12:21.530
but the Time-Space Stasis

12:22.230 --> 12:25.020
set by you.

12:26.540 --> 12:28.340
♪No need to ask♪

12:28.840 --> 12:31.620
I trapped her in the Time-Space Stasis.

12:32.590 --> 12:34.660
But once the Sea-Calming Pillar
she forged

12:34.960 --> 12:36.900
exists in time and space,

12:36.960 --> 12:38.220
it will never vanish.

12:39.510 --> 12:40.730
I've lost.

12:44.750 --> 12:45.540
No wonder.

12:46.710 --> 12:48.340
No wonder people outside say

12:48.920 --> 12:51.340
the Sea-Calming Pillar appeared
out of nowhere.

12:51.360 --> 12:53.170
No one knows its origin.

12:54.320 --> 12:56.020
Because that heroine

12:56.040 --> 12:57.690
spent five centuries forging it

12:57.710 --> 12:59.730
in your Time-Space Stasis.

13:00.150 --> 13:01.340
To the outside world,

13:01.790 --> 13:03.090
it was but an instant.

13:07.110 --> 13:09.300
She and I fought for five centuries

13:10.320 --> 13:11.610
in the Time-Space Stasis.

13:13.750 --> 13:15.060
Five centuries.

13:16.270 --> 13:17.060
So,

13:17.910 --> 13:20.450
the mastermind
behind all these disasters

13:21.720 --> 13:22.810
is you.

13:28.550 --> 13:29.730
In the Witch-Demon War,

13:31.160 --> 13:33.300
I deceived the Witch Clan ancestor,

13:34.080 --> 13:36.490
planting in him the ambition
to rule all.

13:36.750 --> 13:37.850
In the Deity-Demon War,

13:38.510 --> 13:41.060
I stirred enmity
between the Human and Demon Clans,

13:41.480 --> 13:43.250
pushing them to a final, bloody battle.

13:43.270 --> 13:43.940
You also deceived

13:44.600 --> 13:45.980
the Two Saints of Westdawn,

13:46.000 --> 13:47.420
making them sneak
into the Dragon Palace,

13:47.550 --> 13:50.220
unleashing this catastrophic calamity.

13:50.510 --> 13:51.700
You all believed

13:51.910 --> 13:54.940
the Two Saints of Westdawn
pulled every string in secret,

13:56.080 --> 13:57.100
never suspecting

13:57.670 --> 13:58.980
that from beginning to end,

13:59.960 --> 14:01.060
those Two Saints

14:02.120 --> 14:04.220
were nothing but puppets in my hands.

14:04.240 --> 14:05.460
You infiltrated the Dragon Palace,

14:05.670 --> 14:06.820
and everyone assumed

14:07.360 --> 14:09.250
you wanted to free the Demon Emperor
to weaken the Three Sects

14:09.270 --> 14:11.100
so the Westdawn Sect
could reap all the spoils.

14:11.120 --> 14:12.610
But your real aim was...

14:12.630 --> 14:13.890
To destroy the Sea-Calming Pillar

14:13.910 --> 14:14.980
and free the Demon Emperor,

14:15.000 --> 14:16.100
so I can prove to Fate

14:16.120 --> 14:18.650
that I wasn't beaten
by the last Chosen One.

14:23.910 --> 14:26.300
I've seen every Chosen One,

14:28.270 --> 14:30.100
and no one saw through it.

14:31.630 --> 14:32.130
You

14:33.200 --> 14:34.370
are the first.

14:34.630 --> 14:35.420
So,

14:35.960 --> 14:38.580
you want to trap me with the same trick.

14:39.550 --> 14:41.700
Can you do better
than that Quasi-Saint

14:42.000 --> 14:43.220
from a thousand years ago?

14:43.790 --> 14:44.580
Yes.

14:45.870 --> 14:48.340
You're in the Time-Space Stasis.

14:49.440 --> 14:50.730
How can you do it?

14:50.790 --> 14:52.490
I've already placed

14:52.510 --> 14:53.940
all the pieces.

14:54.120 --> 14:56.300
I need only wait for them to move,

14:56.510 --> 14:58.700
and they will break your scheme.

15:00.720 --> 15:01.580
First step:

15:02.360 --> 15:03.820
Amassing troops to build momentum.

15:33.670 --> 15:34.490
Second step:

15:35.440 --> 15:36.700
Reinforcements to aid the fight.

15:40.320 --> 15:41.460
Where are the reinforcements?

15:45.240 --> 15:46.730
The Ascendance troops are here.

15:46.750 --> 15:47.940
The Elucidating and Seizing Sects
will arrive soon.

15:47.960 --> 15:50.250
Form ranks to face the Demon Emperor.

15:59.440 --> 16:00.490
A thousand years ago,

16:00.720 --> 16:02.940
even the Three Sects lost to him.

16:02.960 --> 16:03.940
These people

16:04.750 --> 16:05.490
are not enough.

16:05.510 --> 16:06.700
Third step:

16:07.270 --> 16:09.100
Entering the mightiest deity.

16:19.630 --> 16:20.420
Voidcity.

16:20.960 --> 16:21.730
Demon Emperor.

16:21.910 --> 16:23.220
After a thousand years,

16:24.720 --> 16:26.420
you've changed so much.

16:28.000 --> 16:28.770
In this battle,

16:29.120 --> 16:30.650
the Demon Emperor was caught off guard,

16:30.840 --> 16:32.180
while the Grand Mage of Voidcity

16:32.200 --> 16:34.100
had armed himself fully.

16:34.510 --> 16:36.850
Subduing the Demon Emperor
was no trouble.

16:45.750 --> 16:47.340
Primordial Vessel!

16:47.720 --> 16:48.730
Break!

16:51.000 --> 16:51.890
Demon-Subduing Eye!

16:52.910 --> 16:53.700
Open!

17:07.110 --> 17:09.860
Try my thousand-year Rotbreath!

17:13.270 --> 17:14.460
Wind-Stilling Pearl!

17:15.350 --> 17:16.140
Take it in!

17:31.270 --> 17:32.420
But don't forget:

17:33.110 --> 17:35.490
The Demon Emperor's soul is in Yunxiao.

17:35.680 --> 17:36.660
The one hurt

17:37.510 --> 17:40.140
is only Fairy Yunxiao's body.

17:40.270 --> 17:42.090
So, this was also your design.

17:42.960 --> 17:43.730
My design?

17:45.550 --> 17:47.660
I merely serve Fate.

17:47.680 --> 17:49.010
But you surely did not expect

17:49.720 --> 17:51.620
that I kept one move hidden.

17:54.240 --> 17:55.140
All those attacks

17:55.160 --> 17:56.860
were only to pin down the Demon Emperor.

17:57.680 --> 17:59.050
The true key

18:01.270 --> 18:01.940
lies there.

18:05.030 --> 18:05.900
It's her.

18:06.260 --> 18:07.110
[Before the Time-Space Stasis]

18:07.110 --> 18:07.980
When?

18:08.440 --> 18:11.140
As the Time-Space Stasis began.

18:19.680 --> 18:21.290
You found me in the end.

18:21.510 --> 18:22.730
If you still seek atonement,

18:23.030 --> 18:24.010
answer me one question.

18:24.310 --> 18:26.660
Kuai Si controlled Qi Yuan, my mentor,

18:26.790 --> 18:27.810
with a magic instrument.

18:27.960 --> 18:29.380
Was it the Rank-XII Golden Lotus?

18:30.070 --> 18:32.050
It was merely modeled

18:33.110 --> 18:34.460
on the Rank-XII Golden Lotus.

18:36.240 --> 18:37.290
Its power was limited.

18:37.310 --> 18:39.570
It could only bind Aureate Immortals.

18:39.920 --> 18:42.250
But the principles are the same, right?

18:42.480 --> 18:43.250
Exactly.

18:45.350 --> 18:46.290
The so-called Golden Lotus

18:47.720 --> 18:49.980
is merely a soul hidden in blood water.

18:50.750 --> 18:51.570
When the mind is confused,

18:52.960 --> 18:54.330
this soul

18:55.160 --> 18:56.700
can sneak into the body

18:57.920 --> 18:59.620
and finally control that body.

18:59.880 --> 19:02.490
So, if we drain out this blood water,

19:02.680 --> 19:04.900
we can break the Rank-XII Golden Lotus.

19:04.960 --> 19:06.010
What are you going to do?

19:06.510 --> 19:08.010
Drain out the soul?

19:08.310 --> 19:09.700
Wen Jing is from the Blood Gnat Clan.

19:10.270 --> 19:10.900
Drawing blood

19:11.510 --> 19:12.700
is her specialty.

19:12.920 --> 19:14.250
I see.

19:15.920 --> 19:17.420
As long as you weaken the Demon Emperor

19:17.920 --> 19:19.810
and let Wen Jing drain his blood,

19:20.350 --> 19:22.380
you can rescue Fairy Yunxiao.

19:22.880 --> 19:24.220
But have you considered this?

19:25.510 --> 19:27.570
When the Demon Emperor's blood
enters Wen Jing's body,

19:27.720 --> 19:30.380
Wen Jing will also be controlled
by his soul.

19:33.110 --> 19:33.900
What?

19:35.200 --> 19:36.380
Have you run out of tricks?

19:41.720 --> 19:43.050
The Blood Sea

19:43.960 --> 19:45.620
is practically barren.

19:46.110 --> 19:47.570
Yet there's a kind of tree

19:50.110 --> 19:51.490
that can grow there.

19:53.270 --> 19:54.620
It's called the Blood Sea Tree.

19:58.440 --> 19:59.700
The blossoms of the Blood Sea Tree

20:00.830 --> 20:01.730
are lovely.

20:02.960 --> 20:03.900
So lovely.

20:05.400 --> 20:06.940
When they're in full bloom,

20:07.830 --> 20:09.290
the whole Blood Sea

20:09.830 --> 20:12.460
becomes a dreamlike vision.

20:13.550 --> 20:15.250
But the nectar of these flowers

20:18.720 --> 20:20.420
won't dissolve in the Blood Sea's water.

20:22.160 --> 20:24.490
For our blood-sucking Blood Gnat Clan,

20:29.240 --> 20:30.700
it's an inescapable, lethal poison.

20:35.830 --> 20:37.620
You actually got her to go this far.

20:38.160 --> 20:38.940
It wasn't me.

20:41.110 --> 20:42.490
She chose this herself.

20:43.000 --> 20:44.810
Once I drink the Demon Emperor's blood,

20:45.590 --> 20:46.900
what the Demon Emperor gets

20:48.510 --> 20:50.290
will be a dying body.

20:51.160 --> 20:51.940
Thus,

20:52.680 --> 20:54.290
we can destroy the Demon Emperor.

20:58.590 --> 21:00.980
No matter the outcome of this war,

21:01.830 --> 21:03.330
I'll atone with my life.

21:05.750 --> 21:06.530
Is that enough?

21:12.550 --> 21:14.050
Brilliant, brilliant.

21:14.920 --> 21:16.380
The Demon Emperor has yet to appear,

21:16.680 --> 21:18.530
yet you've already set
four deadly schemes.

21:19.070 --> 21:22.250
How relentless, each step interlocking.

21:23.350 --> 21:26.420
You're the cleverest Chosen One
I've ever seen.

21:28.720 --> 21:30.090
I'm beginning to understand

21:31.400 --> 21:33.330
why, in this life's Great Tribulation,

21:33.640 --> 21:35.660
Fate chose Yunxiao first

21:36.480 --> 21:38.250
and then chose you at the last minute.

21:38.880 --> 21:40.460
If we had met earlier in past lives,

21:41.110 --> 21:42.900
we could have been close friends.

21:43.750 --> 21:44.700
I'll pass on that.

21:45.110 --> 21:45.900
My apologies.

21:46.030 --> 21:47.090
You carry too much karma.

21:47.110 --> 21:48.220
I won't get involved.

21:50.640 --> 21:51.770
Do you think

21:52.200 --> 21:53.490
victory is already yours?

21:53.750 --> 21:55.010
By my calculations,

21:55.030 --> 21:56.290
once these four moves are done,

21:56.310 --> 21:57.290
my chance of victory is...

21:57.310 --> 21:58.250
98%.

22:00.030 --> 22:01.770
You think only you can deduce it?

22:02.790 --> 22:04.730
I was once the Chosen One.

22:04.880 --> 22:06.490
Your method is brilliant,

22:07.110 --> 22:09.530
but you missed one thing.

22:10.070 --> 22:11.220
I missed something?

22:11.680 --> 22:12.730
What did I miss?

22:13.110 --> 22:14.700
The Pregenesis Sword.

22:14.960 --> 22:16.250
In the Deity-Demon War,

22:16.720 --> 22:18.660
the Demon Emperor
ruled the Three Realms.

22:19.000 --> 22:21.570
He relied on the Pregenesis Sword

22:21.590 --> 22:24.220
that foils magic arts.

22:24.720 --> 22:26.140
With that Sword in hand,

22:26.480 --> 22:27.530
do your schemes

22:28.110 --> 22:29.460
still stand a chance?

22:29.790 --> 22:31.490
That Sword bested me twice.

22:31.510 --> 22:32.980
How could I overlook that?

22:34.750 --> 22:35.700
Of course not.

22:36.160 --> 22:36.940
So,

22:37.480 --> 22:38.490
you made arrangements.

22:43.110 --> 22:43.900
What?

22:44.830 --> 22:45.900
You lost your tongue?

22:46.030 --> 22:47.530
Afraid I'll spot your flaw?

22:51.310 --> 22:52.490
In the Witch-Demon War,

22:53.000 --> 22:55.180
I saw that Witch Clan hero

22:55.270 --> 22:56.730
forge the Pregenesis Sword.

22:56.960 --> 22:59.770
He feared outsiders might wield it,

23:00.070 --> 23:03.090
so he placed a restraint on it:

23:04.440 --> 23:05.730
Ancestral Wu blood.

23:08.200 --> 23:09.570
Without Ancestral Wu blood,

23:09.880 --> 23:13.660
it's just an ordinary sword.

23:14.510 --> 23:16.860
Back then, the Demon Emperor kept

23:16.880 --> 23:18.700
all Ancestral Witch heirs in his palace

23:19.200 --> 23:20.460
as living blood reserves.

23:20.720 --> 23:22.010
Each time he went to battle,

23:22.270 --> 23:23.770
he used the Pregenesis Sword

23:24.030 --> 23:25.460
to slay an heir.

23:29.070 --> 23:30.900
You won't find Ancestral Witch heirs.

23:30.920 --> 23:32.490
Because you let them leave.

23:37.830 --> 23:40.090
You sent them to a refuge

23:40.640 --> 23:42.380
and set a formation to guard them.

23:44.240 --> 23:46.770
Paper butterflies mark the only path.

23:54.640 --> 23:55.490
What are you doing?

23:56.030 --> 23:57.810
What kind of labor is this?

23:57.830 --> 23:59.330
This isn't labor.

23:59.920 --> 24:00.980
We're fleeing for our lives.

24:01.790 --> 24:02.700
Fleeing from what?

24:02.790 --> 24:04.490
The Grandlord sent a dream order.

24:04.510 --> 24:05.530
On the wedding day,

24:05.550 --> 24:06.860
we're to find a place to hide.

24:06.920 --> 24:07.660
Today, for all we know,

24:07.680 --> 24:09.250
a great demon may come for us.

24:09.270 --> 24:10.180
A great demon?

24:12.880 --> 24:14.420
Did you hear something?

24:28.590 --> 24:29.380
Impossible.

24:30.240 --> 24:31.900
You'll never find
the Bear Stockade people.

24:32.270 --> 24:33.490
I spent three days in the East Sea...

24:33.510 --> 24:35.180
Finding the most hidden spot.

24:37.200 --> 24:38.220
Have you considered

24:38.240 --> 24:39.660
that this hidden spot

24:39.790 --> 24:41.050
was a trap

24:41.750 --> 24:43.570
set just for you?

24:45.510 --> 24:46.810
You are so cautious.

24:47.310 --> 24:49.050
When you brought
the Bear Stockade people here,

24:49.440 --> 24:51.980
you must have left them a hiding place.

24:52.110 --> 24:54.290
I only had to create such a place.

24:54.830 --> 24:55.940
With your skills,

24:56.750 --> 24:58.050
you'd surely find it.

24:58.440 --> 24:59.220
Impossible.

24:59.270 --> 25:00.090
Absolutely impossible.

25:00.110 --> 25:02.140
They only came here three days ago.

25:02.270 --> 25:03.900
In so little time, how could you...?

25:08.480 --> 25:10.420
You foresaw this years ago?

25:11.480 --> 25:12.290
As I told you,

25:14.400 --> 25:15.940
you are not the only seer.

26:08.440 --> 26:09.810
Do you remember now?

26:10.200 --> 26:11.660
A thousand years ago,

26:11.680 --> 26:15.730
I crushed your Three Sects.

26:16.070 --> 26:17.900
With the Pregenesis Sword,

26:17.920 --> 26:20.090
who dares oppose me?

26:37.720 --> 26:38.940
Do you know where you lost

26:39.510 --> 26:40.900
in this move?

26:41.000 --> 26:42.090
Where did I lose?

26:46.270 --> 26:47.700
You were too cautious.

26:47.720 --> 26:48.770
Is caution a fault?

26:48.830 --> 26:50.380
That's why

26:50.550 --> 26:53.460
you became easy to read.

26:53.510 --> 26:54.770
Every step you take

26:55.240 --> 26:56.660
is flawlessly precise.

26:56.880 --> 26:58.530
Once I know your goal,

26:58.750 --> 27:00.900
I can predict your every move.

27:02.350 --> 27:03.220
As I said,

27:04.720 --> 27:07.330
you are the smartest
Chosen One I've seen.

27:08.200 --> 27:08.810
But

27:09.510 --> 27:11.730
also the easiest to beat.

27:12.350 --> 27:12.810
I...

27:14.720 --> 27:17.050
Every Chosen One I've met before

27:18.070 --> 27:20.010
made surprise moves.

27:20.480 --> 27:21.250
Foolish as they were,

27:22.400 --> 27:24.420
they still caught me off guard.

27:26.070 --> 27:26.860
But

27:27.550 --> 27:28.700
I only had to tweak

27:29.510 --> 27:31.420
your move

27:31.880 --> 27:34.700
to speed up the Great Tribulation.

27:36.750 --> 27:38.290
You're using me.

27:40.590 --> 27:42.010
Why did this Great Tribulation

27:42.440 --> 27:44.420
come after only a thousand years?

27:46.790 --> 27:47.730
Because

27:48.720 --> 27:50.220
you sped all this up.

28:02.880 --> 28:04.010
I did all this

28:04.960 --> 28:06.730
for Fate.

28:09.880 --> 28:10.700
Fate.

28:11.310 --> 28:12.490
Did you see?

28:12.880 --> 28:15.220
I'm your best pawn.

28:18.240 --> 28:19.250
You saw me.

28:20.160 --> 28:21.220
You heard me.

28:21.310 --> 28:22.570
You responded to me.

28:26.070 --> 28:26.900
Fate,

28:27.110 --> 28:29.420
I helped you start
this Great Tribulation.

28:29.880 --> 28:32.140
I helped you destroy the world.

28:32.310 --> 28:35.330
Only I understand your will.

28:35.510 --> 28:37.380
Look at me again, Fate.

28:37.480 --> 28:39.180
Look at me again.

28:43.300 --> 28:43.900
[Celestial Emperor strikes]

28:44.060 --> 28:45.060
[Formation]

28:45.260 --> 28:46.540
[Chaos Bell]

28:46.540 --> 28:47.140
[Demon Emperor appears]

28:47.140 --> 28:47.860
[Water Dragon Spout]

28:48.100 --> 28:49.740
[Wen Jing attacks]

28:56.590 --> 28:57.380
Wen Jing.

28:58.550 --> 28:59.330
Wen Jing.

29:19.510 --> 29:20.900
You still remember me?

29:21.960 --> 29:23.140
Yes.

29:25.270 --> 29:26.220
In these past thousand years,

29:26.510 --> 29:28.010
though I've forgotten much,

29:29.920 --> 29:31.290
I still remember you.

29:31.860 --> 29:34.580
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

29:38.030 --> 29:38.900
Are you okay?

29:43.510 --> 29:45.050
What do you remember?

29:48.200 --> 29:48.980
I remember

29:50.110 --> 29:51.730
you were hunted down

29:53.510 --> 29:54.570
and wounded

29:55.240 --> 29:56.010
that day, just like today.

29:57.440 --> 29:59.050
Then, you fell into my palm.

30:01.000 --> 30:02.530
And then?

30:03.200 --> 30:04.090
Then

30:05.790 --> 30:06.980
you drank my blood,

30:07.830 --> 30:09.220
slept in my bed,

30:10.400 --> 30:11.770
and made the juniors think

30:11.790 --> 30:13.490
I hadn't bathed in ages.

30:19.830 --> 30:21.420
And after that?

30:24.510 --> 30:25.420
And then,

30:28.510 --> 30:29.980
we were together,

30:31.000 --> 30:31.770
sharing company.

30:33.310 --> 30:34.900
You even practiced swordplay with me.

30:36.160 --> 30:38.380
And so many years passed.

30:40.720 --> 30:42.220
So many years.

30:43.590 --> 30:45.140
Let's stop here.

30:55.110 --> 30:55.900
Alright.

30:57.350 --> 30:58.290
We

30:59.350 --> 31:01.010
will stop here.

31:01.010 --> 31:04.100
[Wen Jing ambushes]

31:05.920 --> 31:07.420
There must be something I missed.

31:08.750 --> 31:10.570
There's a way
to avoid the Great Tribulation.

31:12.920 --> 31:13.730
There must be.

31:14.240 --> 31:15.250
There must be.

31:15.510 --> 31:16.980
There must be.

31:22.200 --> 31:23.810
Little Uncle.

31:32.880 --> 31:33.770
Senior, go!

31:35.790 --> 31:36.700
Changshou, go!

31:44.830 --> 31:45.530
No, that's wrong.

31:46.550 --> 31:47.380
No, that can't be.

31:48.110 --> 31:49.250
There must be a way.

31:49.790 --> 31:50.860
There has to be a way.

32:04.000 --> 32:05.090
But if only heroes

32:05.110 --> 32:06.700
could stop the Great Tribulation,

32:06.790 --> 32:08.700
why did you appear then?

32:14.110 --> 32:14.900
Yunxiao,

32:15.550 --> 32:16.570
you are my only chance.

32:16.590 --> 32:17.490
Wake up!

32:17.510 --> 32:18.660
Is caution a fault?

32:18.680 --> 32:20.140
That's why

32:20.350 --> 32:22.490
you became easy to read.

32:22.510 --> 32:23.700
There must be a way out.

32:23.720 --> 32:24.570
Li Changshou,

32:24.880 --> 32:26.090
you've lost.

32:30.700 --> 32:31.180
[Demon Emperor appears]

32:42.260 --> 32:44.060
[Demon Emperor appears]

32:44.920 --> 32:46.530
There must be a way out.

32:46.550 --> 32:47.530
There has to be.

32:54.920 --> 32:56.770
Li Changshou,

32:57.110 --> 32:58.380
do you like

32:58.550 --> 32:59.900
the Great Tribulation?

33:14.440 --> 33:15.530
Have you figured it out?

33:18.720 --> 33:19.700
Yes.

33:20.310 --> 33:22.010
I figured out that everyone will die.

33:23.440 --> 33:24.620
Your predecessors

33:24.880 --> 33:26.330
deduced for over ten thousand years,

33:27.160 --> 33:28.330
all in vain.

33:32.000 --> 33:33.140
How long has it been?

33:33.720 --> 33:34.980
If you ask about time,

33:35.550 --> 33:36.770
less than an instant.

33:38.110 --> 33:39.420
If you ask about experience,

33:40.160 --> 33:41.810
3,600 years.

33:42.310 --> 33:43.900
3,600 years...

33:49.550 --> 33:51.010
Less than an instant.

33:52.510 --> 33:53.330
Don't worry.

33:54.590 --> 33:55.620
Soon,

33:56.030 --> 33:57.290
you'll forget

33:58.030 --> 33:59.420
their grudges,

34:00.110 --> 34:01.620
their names,

34:02.350 --> 34:03.620
and even yourself,

34:04.510 --> 34:05.220
just like me.

34:05.720 --> 34:06.660
By then,

34:09.760 --> 34:11.420
there will be no more pain.

34:14.510 --> 34:15.260
Jin Chan,

34:19.320 --> 34:21.300
you exhausted a lifetime's cultivation

34:22.070 --> 34:24.980
to trap me in this Time-Space Stasis.

34:26.320 --> 34:27.340
Was it worth it?

34:30.000 --> 34:31.900
I'm forsaken by Fate,

34:33.110 --> 34:34.460
outside of samsara.

34:35.230 --> 34:36.690
A lifetime's cultivation
is nothing to me.

34:37.590 --> 34:39.130
I'll just cultivate again from scratch.

34:40.440 --> 34:41.300
This lifetime,

34:42.190 --> 34:44.010
meeting a genius like you

34:44.920 --> 34:45.690
was worth it.

34:51.110 --> 34:52.210
Let me show you something.

34:57.030 --> 34:58.210
What do you want to show me?

35:02.110 --> 35:03.860
I'll show you what I've deduced.

35:20.360 --> 35:21.130
Tired?

35:26.030 --> 35:26.900
How long has it been

35:28.440 --> 35:30.090
since you had a proper meal?

35:34.800 --> 35:35.740
You old fool.

35:37.360 --> 35:38.260
Where did you get it?

35:39.510 --> 35:40.490
Ascendance Sect.

35:50.110 --> 35:51.090
It's a good place.

35:53.510 --> 35:54.300
It's just

35:55.510 --> 35:57.780
another Mortal Realm.

35:59.960 --> 36:00.740
You're

36:02.280 --> 36:04.610
deducing things,

36:04.630 --> 36:06.300
day and night, every moment.

36:07.960 --> 36:08.740
Aren't you tired?

36:09.510 --> 36:10.530
I've gotten used to it.

36:12.070 --> 36:13.690
So, have you figured it out?

36:17.400 --> 36:19.050
I thought I had.

36:20.320 --> 36:21.610
But things only get more complicated

36:22.550 --> 36:23.490
and chaotic.

36:25.400 --> 36:26.380
You were wrong?

36:28.510 --> 36:29.420
So you feel defeated?

36:32.000 --> 36:33.210
Have you ever thought

36:34.150 --> 36:35.570
that being wrong

36:37.320 --> 36:38.900
is actually normal?

36:40.710 --> 36:42.090
You've always been right.

36:42.400 --> 36:44.490
You get one wrong occasionally,

36:45.710 --> 36:47.490
and you feel like the sky is falling.

36:49.800 --> 36:51.210
Then look at me.

36:52.320 --> 36:53.690
I'm always wrong.

36:53.710 --> 36:55.170
I'm never right.

36:55.440 --> 36:58.130
Yet I've lived safely till now.

37:00.590 --> 37:02.380
All thanks to me.

37:08.070 --> 37:08.860
Yes.

37:09.550 --> 37:10.940
With a disciple to shoulder it,

37:12.150 --> 37:14.650
the mentor can make mistakes freely.

37:18.440 --> 37:19.210
Changshou,

37:20.150 --> 37:21.300
have you ever thought

37:22.710 --> 37:24.490
that someone will shoulder it for you

37:25.510 --> 37:27.130
when you make a mistake?

37:30.550 --> 37:31.380
Will there be?

37:37.510 --> 37:38.300
I know.

37:41.030 --> 37:43.380
You always feel you're alone.

37:46.150 --> 37:46.980
But Changshou,

37:48.800 --> 37:50.490
do you still remember

37:52.670 --> 37:55.460
a bird flying overhead,

37:57.280 --> 37:58.490
sweeping past?

37:58.800 --> 38:00.300
Splat! A dropping

38:00.550 --> 38:02.420
nearly hit your shoulder.

38:03.710 --> 38:05.690
Do you recall us

38:06.710 --> 38:08.900
sitting by Jade Division's pond,

38:08.920 --> 38:10.820
catching a tiny fish,

38:10.840 --> 38:13.050
and making a big pot of fish soup?

38:14.360 --> 38:16.380
Have you ever thought

38:16.400 --> 38:18.090
of those missing sheep

38:18.110 --> 38:21.210
eating only flowers, not grass?

38:22.000 --> 38:22.900
And

38:23.480 --> 38:25.090
your Junior Ling'e, who ate little

38:25.110 --> 38:26.820
but always stayed plump

38:26.840 --> 38:29.210
and so mischievous?

38:36.630 --> 38:37.690
Changshou,

38:40.110 --> 38:41.530
all these years,

38:42.360 --> 38:44.090
many people, many things

38:46.960 --> 38:48.460
have surrounded you.

38:53.230 --> 38:55.490
You have never been alone.

39:40.470 --> 39:46.250
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

39:46.920 --> 39:53.620
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

39:55.150 --> 40:01.200
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

40:01.830 --> 40:08.280
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

40:09.020 --> 40:16.140
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

40:16.520 --> 40:23.420
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

40:23.800 --> 40:31.150
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

40:31.150 --> 40:38.320
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

40:54.460 --> 40:59.630
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

41:00.720 --> 41:07.740
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

41:08.930 --> 41:14.870
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

41:15.570 --> 41:22.650
♪Alas, our story is short♪

41:22.990 --> 41:30.100
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

41:30.420 --> 41:36.900
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

41:37.680 --> 41:44.890
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

41:45.280 --> 41:53.100
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
